  {
   "title": "Boise State legend Kellen Moore immortalized with 11-foot bronze statue",
   "link": "https://www.arbiteronline.com/2026/11/02/boise-state-legend-kellen-moore-immortalized-with-11-foot-bronze-statue/",
   "source": "The Arbiter",
   "summary": "<p>The legacy of the winningest quarterback in college football history was permanently etched into Albertsons Stadium, as an 11-foot bronze statue of Boise State legend Kellen Moore was unveiled on The Blue during halftime.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.arbiteronline.com/2026/11/02/boise-state-legend-kellen-moore-immortalized-with-11-foot-bronze-statue/\">Boise State legend Kellen Moore immortalized with 11-foot bronze statue</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.arbiteronline.com\">The Arbiter</a>.</p>",
